        "attribute": {
          "description": "List of attributes related to site analytics. If these are provided, then only those attributes will be part of response along with the default attributes.\nExamples: `attribute=coverageAverage` (single attribute requested) `attribute=coverageFailureMetrics&attribute=coverageTotalCount` (multiple attributes requested)\n",
